# Per-host client settings for a tailnet broker (copy to each host, then edit).
# No secrets live here: swb has no credentials, and v0.3.0 end tokens are
# written by `swb hook` under SWB_STATE_DIR, never into the environment.
#
# http only, host:port, no path and no trailing slash. The host must be one of
# the broker's SWB_MCP_ALLOWED_HOSTS names.
SWB_BROKER_URL=http://swb.your-tailnet.ts.net:8080
# This host's name in agent ids ([A-Za-z0-9._-]); unique per host.
SWB_HOST=host-a
# Per-host and per-user; never shared over NFS or synced between hosts.
SWB_STATE_DIR=$HOME/.local/state/swb
# SWB_SESSION_PID and SWB_PROC_START are per session: the launcher that starts
# the harness exports them from its own pid (see examples/one-host/run.sh).
